  "description": "<h1>RCTA - Ghost [Warzone 1]</h1>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/k8QFEvE.png\" alt=\"image\" /></p>\n<p>This mod adds Ghost into Tarkov. You can now play as Ghost wowww.</p>\n<hr />\n<h1>Mod Includes:</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Jawbone A [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Jawbone B [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Jawbone C [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Jawbone D [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Jawbone [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Jawbone A [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Jawbone B [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Ghosted A [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Ghosted B [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Ghosted C [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Ghosted D [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Ghosted [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Ghosted A [Head] (BEAR/USEC)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<ul>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Dreadwood A [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Dreadwood B [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Dreadwood C [Top] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n<li><strong>RCTA Ghost Dreadwood [Bottom] (BEAR/USEC) (RAGMAN)</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h1>Credits:</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.infinityward.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Infinity Ward</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://www.callofduty.com/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Call of Duty</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://github.com/WelcomeToTarkov\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT</a> for CommonLib</li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/user/62485/wuvgawore\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WUVGAWORE</a> for Porting</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<h1>Recommend Mods:</h1>\n<ul>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1277/wtt-head-and-voice-selector\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WTT - Head and Voice Selector</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2008/transmog\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Transmog</a></li>\n</ul>\n",
